# /health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### ping
GET http://localhost:8080/ping

### /auth register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "user-student",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "pass@123"
}

### /login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "pass@123"
}

### /books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### prestar libro 1
# @name prestamoLibro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": 1
}

### mis préstamos de libros
GET http://localhost:8080/api/loans/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### devolver libro
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/loans/{{prestamoLibro.response.body.id}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
### Laptops: sustituir TOKEN_ADMIN, TOKEN_USER e IDs por valores reales
POST http://localhost:8080/api/laptops
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_ADMIN
Content-Type: application/json

{"serial":"DELL-001","brand":"Dell","model":"Latitude"}

### Inventario
GET http://localhost:8080/api/laptops
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_USER

### Prestar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/laptop-loans
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_USER
Content-Type: application/json

{"laptop_id":1}

### Historial
GET http://localhost:8080/api/laptop-loans/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_USER

### Devolver (ID del préstamo)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/laptop-loans/1/return
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_USER
